WEBVTT

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:14.690
<i>To recap the previous episode: 
My transformation made me into a man.</i>

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:20.200
Um... this must be some kind of mistake.

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:21.990
Thumbs up.

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:57.010
<b>Magical Girl - Ore</b>

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:01.300
No, no, no! There must be some mistake!

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:07.350
What? I can't understand you if you don't 
talk in more normal words, dammit.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:09.730
What's with the sudden proper mascot act?

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:14.530
Look, men's bodies are more suited 
to fighting, aren't they?

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:16.280
What's weird about that?

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.150
Appealing to realism, is he?

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:19.280
What about the outfit, then?

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:22.950
Well, magical girls gotta 
be cute, don't they?

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:24.330
That's contradictory!

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:26.330
At least make it
one or the other!

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.790
What kind of magical world approved this?

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:29.790
It's trendy, I'd say.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:30.870
How?!

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:35.170
Sure, I've got a body now, but I'm more
"ripped" than I am "stacked"!

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:40.800
<i>What a bleak atmosphere...</i>

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:44.510
<i>This isn't the sort of atmosphere 
a magical girl should debut in...</i>

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:47.220
<i>But, more than anything...</i>

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:55.020
<i>My heart is overflowing with the need to 
keep Mohiro-chan from realizing who I am!</i>

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:56.320
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:57.820
<i>How should I handle this?</i>

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:00.490
<i>What am I going to do?</i>

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:13.630
I am a passing (male) magical girl of justice!
 I travel the land, defeating demons!

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:18.760
<i>Uno Saki decided that in order to lie about 
her identity, she must lie to herself.</i>

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:21.720
I see that's really got you fired up, dammit!

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:22.800
Yahoo!

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:25.260
Of course, I'm gonna wreak havoc!

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.560
<i>I seriously hate this.
I wanna go home.</i>

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:36.360
This just might work.

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.410
I'm not making a dent!

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:55.630
Don't you have some kind of magical item 
that'll send them all flying or something?

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.420
Take out your hairpins and throw them!

00:03:58.800 --> 00:03:59.760
You got it!

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:07.760
<i>They look like ordinary hairpins 
to me... but what are they really?</i>

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.850
<i>Do they exorcise the enemy or something?</i>

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.700
Magical grenades.

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.700
<i>It's a yak weapon!</i>

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:28.830
Um... how about something 
less... conspicuous?

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:33.250
How about this magical handgun? 
It's got unlimited ammo.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:37.040
No! Something better suited 
to a magic newbie, please!

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:40.670
Something more "beginner," 
please! I'm begging you!

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:43.340
Goddamn. You're a picky one, huh?

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:47.090
If you weren't a magical girl, I'd give 
you the back of my hand, dammit...

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:50.060
<i>The magical girl life is far too violent...</i>

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.810
How about this, then?

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:58.360
Why oil paper? This is what
 you guys wrap guns in!

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.740
Now <i>this </i>is magical!

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:11.080
But... does it explode or 
fire laser beams or something?

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:14.200
It doesn't do anything 
dangerous. Just calm down.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.330
<i>I can do this, then...</i>

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:18.710
In that case...

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.210
Get ready, you demons!

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:23.420
My magic is gonna finish you!

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.900
<i>It really doesn't do anything.</i>

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:42.820
Um, does it have any functionality at all?

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:45.570
It's just a rod.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:48.070
How am I supposed to use it?

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:51.030
You'll have to beat 'em down with it.

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:52.990
The enemy's on the move already.

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:57.500
I think it's important to take
initiative in anything you do.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.000
Fight hard, magical girl!

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.550
Show me what you got!

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:23.820
There's nothing magical 
about any of this.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:29.030
Everything's fancy except firepower. 
That's the rule in this business.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:31.280
Well? Magical, huh?

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.780
That's harsh! It's too harsh!

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:37.540
The gap between the image and 
the reality is too harsh!

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:40.620
The magical world is even more shocking 
than the entertainment world!

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:44.960
Of course, I don't know anything about the 
depths of the entertainment world, either...

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:51.510
<i>I was so wrapped up in
 the fight, I totally forgot!</i>

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.350
A-Are you hurt?

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:59.310
<i>He's creeped out.
He's creeped out, I can totally tell!</i>

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:05.860
<i>What's with this positive response?</i>

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:10.150
No, no, no... I just did 
what anyone would do.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:14.330
What's your name?

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:17.450
My name? My name, my name...

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:19.500
I'm... I...

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.750
<i>If I tell him my name, he'll 
know, he'll know, he'll know!</i>

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:26.500
I'm... me.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.380
<i>What the heck did I just say?!</i>

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:35.890
It's okay! He totally bought it!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:39.020
Well, it's dangerous here, 
so you'd better go.

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:41.690
I'll be fine. Really, just perfect.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:44.520
<i>I'd better get him home 
before I blow it somehow.</i>

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:06.170
<i>He turned back eight times on his way out.</i>

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.130
<i>That respectfulness of his 
is something else I love.</i>

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:14.680
But... my role is over now, I guess.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:18.560
<i>Speaking of, Kokoro-chan-san
 disappeared at some point, too...</i>

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:20.270
<i>Wonder where he went?</i>

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:24.020
<i>Actually, is it okay for 
me to go home like this?</i>

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:29.480
<i>Wh-What are these two doing here?</i>

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:30.650
<i>When did they get here?</i>

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:32.700
<i>Do they know who I am?</i>

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.700
<i>No, it's fine. It's fine.</i>

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.830
<i>I managed to fool Mohiro-chan 
before, after all...</i>

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:40.790
What is it? It's dangerous here, you know!

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:45.210
Just leave things to this unknown 
(male) magical girl and...

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.040
Well...

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:47.960
you're Saki, aren't you?

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.590
Of course you'd know!

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:52.550
H-How much did you see?

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.470
All of it, more or less.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:09:00.100
To be specific, we were worried about you, 
so we waited in front of your house.

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.350
Drag drag

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.060
Then you came bursting out.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:06.100
Then you professed your love for my 
brother at the top of your lungs.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:10.190
You really saw all of it, huh? I guess so...

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:15.030
And... Manager, why are you crying?

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:16.780
And why the camera?

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:19.780
I'm just... so moved.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:25.460
The truth is... I'm a huge 
magical girl geek.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:30.710
Getting to see a real magical girl up close 
and personal makes me so... so happy.

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:33.010
I'm so happy, really...

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:36.300
<i>This is the worst confession
 at the worst possible time.</i>

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:35.590
Manager...

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.930
I swear I'll support you!

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:41.760
Let me help you as your supporter...

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:45.230
No, as your magical manager!

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:50.110
<i>This is awful. He's starting to 
come up with new job titles.</i>

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:53.070
Of course, you'll get to 
keep being an idol, too!

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:56.990
Just one word of warning, though: 
idols can't be romantically involved.

00:09:56.990 --> 00:10:02.490
Don't worry, your love for Sakuyo's 
brother will be our little secret!

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:08.250
So you can keep working as an idol, 
and start working as a magical girl!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.420
Alongside me!

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:13.000
So you remembered that part, 
even through the tears...

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:16.920
B-But... I don't want to cause
 trouble for you guys.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:19.090
And I do look like this... right?

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:20.510
Right?

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:23.010
Cute.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:25.520
Another weirdly positive reaction!

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:28.640
Since you're a magical 
girl, you'll need a name.

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:31.900
We could go with your real name! 
How about Magical Girl Saki?

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:34.230
That would make it really obvious who I am!

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.610
That there!

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:40.610
How about Magical Girl Ore
Not bad, huh?

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:42.530
Ore?

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:47.620
<b>Ore</b>
 (Masculine version of "I" or "Me")

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.620
Ore?!

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:51.670
Sweet! In celebration of the birth
 of Magical Girl Ore...

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.920
Let's have a drinking party!

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:55.250
What, looking like this?

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:56.880
Huh?

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:00.510
Of course, you two are underage, 
so no booze for you!

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:01.640
Okay.

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:04.470
Instead, you can have all the 
apple juice you can drink!

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:05.890
Yay...

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:09.600
<i>"There's no going back now."</i>

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:12.440
<i>Saki felt it keenly in that moment.</i>

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:13.690
Where shall we go?

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:15.820
Roppongi? Ever been?

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:17.110
Let's go!

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:19.450
Seriously? You're showing your age.

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:25.280
I see... So that's the new magical girl.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:28.580
Let's see what she can do...

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:45.800
My, what a cheery morning.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:48.180
It's almost like yesterday never happened!

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:53.400
<i>But after I got back to my normal 
form, I had this awful nightmare...</i>

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.770
<i>Was it a premonition?</i>

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:58.860
<i>No... let's not think about it too hard.</i>

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:02.450
Oh? You're leaving awfully early today...

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:05.990
Yeah, I need to talk to Sakuyo about stuff.

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:09.040
You shouldn't skip breakfast, though.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:13.120
You look a bit pale, so take 
something refreshing with you.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:18.210
Let's eat!

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.590
Okay, power times a hundred!

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:24.800
Thank you for the meal.

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:30.980
<i>I came to see her a lot earlier than 
usual... I wonder if Sakuyo's awake.</i>

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:32.600
Mohiro-chan!

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:35.520
I'm so glad I woke up early!

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:38.900
Early birds really get the worm... 
Thank you, god of early awakenings!

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.780
Okay, today I'll talk to him!

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.610
M-M-Mo...

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:45.110
I'm so nervous, my throat closed up!

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:50.410
M-M-Mohi...

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:53.000
<i>I'm acting like a total weirdo right now!</i>

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.080
<i>But I'm scared!</i>

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:55.830
<i>Because... because...</i>

00:12:55.830 --> 00:13:00.750
<i>What if he finds out that the mysterious 
cross-dresser he met yesterday was me?</i>

00:12:55.830 --> 00:13:07.720
<b>Auuuuuuuuuuuuugh</b>

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.130
<i>No, it's okay! It should be okay!</i>

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:07.760
<i>I believe in Mohiro-chan's 
living-national-treasure-level obliviousness!</i>

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.180
<i>Go, Saki!</i>

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.310
<i>If he figures it out, I kill myself.</i>

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:12.470
Mo—

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:13.980
Hyoe!

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:16.480
<i>The other half of his idol duo,</i>

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:19.150
<i>and the one who dragged Mohiro-chan 
into the entertainment world...</i>

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:23.530
<i>Mr. King Sneak-Thief, 
monopolizing his time 24-7...</i>

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.200
<i>The black ships have come!</i>

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:26.360
<i>My sworn enemy!</i>

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:30.870
<i>I can't believe I couldn't even manage 
that total template introduction!</i>

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.790
Well, let's get going, Mohiro!

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:38.540
I hear there's a stalker prowling 
around here these days.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:41.050
Damn you!

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:43.590
Oh, Saki. You're up early.

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.880
M-Morning!

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:50.890
Morning, Sakuyo! Mohiro-chan!

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:52.600
And... Hyoe-san.

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:55.640
Oh, good morning. How 
long have you been here?

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:59.020
I was <i>so</i> wrapped up in my discussion with 
Mohiro that I didn't even notice you.

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:01.190
Why, same to you, Hyoe-san!

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:03.400
D-Damn him!

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:06.030
What are you doing out here so early?

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:09.530
Well, we just have <i>so</i> much work to do today,

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:12.490
and we have<i> all kinds</i> of early 
morning arrangements to do,

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:14.830
and Mohiro can be <i>such </i>
a sleepyhead, you know?

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:18.420
So as his partner, I came to fetch him.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:24.550
Sting sting sting sting

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:21.670
Really, Mohiro would just be <i>nothing</i> without me!

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.380
Oh, I beg to differ!

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:25.420
Mohiro-chan has always been 
an extremely capable person!

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:31.640
By the way... did you know that 
Mohiro is a bit afraid of you?

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:35.430
You're always staring at him like a ravenous animal.

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:35.600
Pant pant pant

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:35.600
Mohiro-chan...

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:37.730
I do <i>not</i> stare at him!

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.270
I just glance his way
 a teeny bit, every so often!

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:43.070
Right? It's not true, right, Mohiro-chan?

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:48.200
<i>W-Why did he look away?!</i>

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.320
Tee-hee-hee!

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:52.320
Well, we'll just be on our way now.

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:53.620
See you later!

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:01.170
Saki... how long have you been 
in love with my brother?

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.170
Wh-Why do you ask?!

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:07.670
Well, I've wanted  
to know for a while...

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:12.430
When <i>did</i> I fall for him?

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:15.220
How he's a man of few words, 
but he's kind and gentle...

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:18.560
How he seems pretty spacey,
 but he's surprisingly reliable...

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:20.810
How he's really good at singing...

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:22.440
He seems like he's not
 thinking about anything...

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:28.150
<b>Stare</b>

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:24.770
and the truth is, he's really 
not thinking about anything...

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:26.650
And how he's really spacy...

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:29.320
I've just always loved all that about him!

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:34.910
But as for the first time I thought
 "I want to protect Mohiro-chan"...

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:42.290
It has to have been that time... 
the time he came to save me.

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:47.000
"I won't ever let Mohiro-chan suffer.

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:50.880
I'm going to protect Mohiro-chan 
from now on, too!" I thought.

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:53.640
Pretty embarrassing, huh?

00:15:57.640 --> 00:15:59.020
I remember that.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:03.560
But I can't root for you
 two getting together.

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:05.150
Sakuyo—

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:06.520
Sorry. I think I forgot something.

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:07.780
Go on without me today.

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.820
Sakuyo...

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:17.660
That's right.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:31.090
<b>Auuuuuuuugh</b>

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:22.330
She must be conflicted over her friend—who's
 like family to her—falling for her brother.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.420
A romantic tangle, like in 
a prime time soap opera.

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:29.710
I'd deluded myself into believing
Sakuyo would forgive me!

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:34.130
I'm so stupid! Stupid, 
stupid, stupid, ¡p!dnts

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:38.100
I should've had more respect for everyone's
 feelings in a delicate matter like this.

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:39.970
Hey. Hey.

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:43.190
Over here! Don't ignore me, dammit!

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:43.640
<i>Where is that voice coming 
from? Heavenly guidance?</i>

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:45.310
Hey. There's a demon.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:49.400
<i>Jeez, that's creepy!</i>

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:53.030
Hey, don't call me creepy!

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:54.780
Hey, don't read my mind!

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:57.990
Sorry, you just really are creepy, though!

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:00.080
Where have you been, anyway?

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:04.670
I was workin' hard, gettin' to be a size 
that'd be easier for you to carry.

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:07.840
I took on this cutie-pie, two-heads-tall 
form so I could look like a real mascot,

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:09.290
and this is the thanks I get?

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:11.710
What kinda monster are you, dammit?!

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:16.890
S-Sorry... But I don't really 
want to carry you around...

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:19.220
W-What's this about a demon, though?

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:22.100
Picked up traces of it just now.

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:23.480
And the target is...

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:25.980
Him again?!

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:31.530
Looks like they were waitin' for 
him to be alone to go after him...

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:34.740
But if we head it off, we can beat 
it before it even makes contact.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:38.240
Alone? But he's supposed to be
with someone else.

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:40.780
Dunno, maybe he's in the bathroom.

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:43.410
Even idols go to the bathroom!

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:46.080
Damn him!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:49.040
But two demon attacks in close succession...

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:52.630
And always appearing around 
a specific person...

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:53.960
Somethin' sure is fishy.

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:55.260
Like what?

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:57.340
Don't know any more than that yet.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:58.640
Still!

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:01.680
No matter how many enemies there are, 
no matter how scared I am...

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:05.350
I will protect Mohiro-chan!

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:09.520
Even if I become a man!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.450
Hurry!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:26.660
I hate that human adaptability 
makes me more comfortable

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:29.380
with the transformation 
the second time around...

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:32.340
That's an important trait to have as a human.

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:35.630
Okay, looks like we headed it off.

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:39.550
So, what's the enemy this 
time? How many machos?

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:42.140
Well, this time you're fighting...

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:44.520
That.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:49.140
What the hell is that attachment, though?!

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:52.400
Well, this one's a tentacle-type demon.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:55.990
Why is everything so freaking creepy today?!

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:58.110
I'm surrounded on all sides, 
enemy and ally alike!

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:02.070
Hey, I'm lovable! You blind 
or something, dammit?

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:04.080
Why is he so certain of that?

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:06.290
And did I make him seriously angry?

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:08.910
Okay, I'll beat that thing quick!

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:10.420
Kokoro-chan-san, my weapon!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:15.920
Sorry... I didn't think we'd be fighting demons 
two days in a row, so I didn't bring any.

00:19:17.170 --> 00:19:19.090
What am I supposed to do, then?!

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:20.800
Give it a blow!

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:22.590
A butt strike or something.

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:26.680
A butt strike? I mean,
I have solid hips now, but...

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:28.270
Then go with a butt kick!

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:30.520
Why are you so obsessed with my butt?!

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:32.270
And while we're arguing, here it comes!

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:39.240
And it's a really violent attack, at that!

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:41.240
Okay, now! Butt attack!

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:45.160
Sticking my butt out now won't 
lead to anything but sadness!

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:49.620
<i>I even can't move, let alone attack!</i>

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:53.380
<i>And I'm glad I transformed, 
but it's still a tight squeeze!</i>

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:57.550
<i>No good... I have to do something,
or Mohiro-chan is going to get...</i>

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:00.840
<i>I haven't even apologized to Sakuyo yet!</i>

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:05.100
<i>Is the protagonist going to die here, 
being subjected to these poses?</i>

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:10.390
<i>Will I just have to lure it in and 
twist it off with my sphincter?</i>

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:11.480
Saki!

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:15.400
Sakuyo!

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:16.320
What are you doing?

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:17.610
It's dangerous, get away!

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:20.280
Also, I don't want you staring 
at me when I'm like this...

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:21.320
No!

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:24.030
No?

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:29.580
If you're going to protect my brother...
then I'm going to protect you!

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.790
I'm sorry about earlier.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:36.380
No! I'm the one who should apologize!

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:38.920
I'm sorry I didn't consider your feelings.

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:41.470
But you're very important to me, too.

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:44.550
So I don't want to see you 
put yourself in danger.

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:49.520
I'll be fine, so please run away.

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:53.190
Thank you, Sakuyo.

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:57.610
Saki...

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:00.610
<i>This feeling...</i>

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:04.070
Hey, titty girl!

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:05.280
Can you do it, too?

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:13.580
Then shout out loud!

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:16.460
Declare your Love Power!

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:18.750
I...

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:29.020
<i>Heungh?</i>

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:34.140
I...

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:38.730
I love Saki!

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:47.240
The second birth.

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:22.040
<i>I'm Uno Saki!</i>

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:24.170
<i>I managed to beat the demon, but...</i>

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:26.460
<i>A new enemy appeared and 
it was a huge shock!</i>

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:29.510
<i>And to think, Sakuyo's transforming, too...</i>

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:31.640
<i>Next time, "Magical Girl - Another"!</i>

00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Magical Girl - Another</b>

00:23:31.640 --> 00:23:34.260
<i>It's a muscle-light message of love!</i>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Illustration: Monokubo
